      "title": "Häny FAIC 650/725",
      "h1": "Häny FAIC 650/725",
      "description": "Automated Grout Plant FAIC 650/725. The compact grout plants consist of the proven, standard Häny components of a mixer, agitator, and grout pump. In its automated execution the plant provides enormou",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "HÄNY",
          "href": "/produkter/haeny",
